---
title: "How does a Google description become vault notes?"
accTitle: "Description to notes pipeline"
accDescr: "HTML is normalized, directive lines and conferencing boilerplate are dropped, remaining text becomes at most two levels of escaped note bullets under the Event Task."
config:
  flowchart:
    rankSpacing: 12
    nodeSpacing: 14
    wrappingWidth: 240
---
flowchart TD
  SRC["`**Google description**<br/>HTML or plain text`"]
  HTML["`**Normalize HTML**<br/>Breaks, links, lists`"]
  DIR["`**Drop directive lines**<br/>@route #offclock -N +M`"]
  DUP["`**Drop duplicates**<br/>Join URL and location`"]
  BOIL["`**Drop boilerplate**<br/>Meet Zoom Teams blocks`"]
  OUTL["`**Build outline**<br/>Paragraphs and lists`"]
  ESC["`**Escape as notes**<br/>Keep child-text rules`"]
  VAULT["`**Vault sub-bullets**<br/>Two levels, tab indent`"]
  EMPTY["`**Write nothing**<br/>Empty after stripping`"]
  SRC ==> HTML
  HTML ==> DIR
  DIR ==> DUP
  DUP ==> BOIL
  BOIL --> OUTL
  BOIL -.->|nothing left| EMPTY
  OUTL ==> ESC
  ESC ==> VAULT
  classDef focus fill:#E8F1FB,stroke:#3B78C2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#0F2E52
  classDef outcome fill:#E7F5EC,stroke:#2E7D4F,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#123D24
  classDef muted fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#1F2937
  class SRC,HTML,DIR,DUP,BOIL,OUTL,ESC focus
  class VAULT outcome
  class EMPTY muted
